---

This tool downloads and runs third-party models at runtime, each under its own
licence:

  * desklib/ai-text-detector-v1.01 (default) — MIT
  * onnx-community/tmr-ai-text-detector-ONNX (`--model light`) — MIT

The models are not distributed with this repository; they are fetched from the
Hugging Face Hub on first use.
